title Vinyl 0.8.0: Remove a network share (D9): the question (its tracks leave the library and the queue, the password asked next), Cancel keeps it, Y removes it (the scenes' helper answers ok): the row goes, the notice says no file was touched
sizes 480x320 800x480
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY full
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE library
env VINYL_DEMO_SHARES queue
keyboards 1
wait 1200
key m
wait 500
tap "Library"
wait 700
tap "Music folders"
wait 900
tap "home-share"
wait 400
tap "Remove"
wait 400
shot 01-question
expect text "Remove home-share?"
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Remove home-share?"
expect text "home-share"
tap "Remove"
wait 300
key y
wait 1300
shot 02-removed
expect text "home-share removed. No file on the server was touched."
expect notext "192.168.68.142 / home-share"
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
key q
wait 500
shot 03-queue-without-it
expect notext "Fences (LeMarquis Remix)"
expect noquit
